    toList "០៩᠋᠍᠏᠙ᢅᢆᢩᢩᤠᤫᤰ᤻᥆᥏᧐᧙ᨗᨛᩕᩞ᩠᩿᩼᪉᪐᪙᪽ᪿ᪰᫝᫠᫫ᬀᬄ᬴᭄᭐᭙᭫᭳ᮀᮂᮡᮭ᮰᮹᯦᯳ᰤ᰷᱀᱉᱐᱙" ++
    toList "᳔᳨᳭᳭᳐᳒᳴᳴᳷᷿᳹᷀‿⁀⁔⁔⃥゙゚⵿⵿〪〯⃐⃜⃡⃡⃰⳯⳱ⷠⷿ꘠꘩꙯꙯ꙴ꙽ꚞꚟ꛰꛱ꠂꠂ꠆꠆ꠋꠋꠣꠧ꠬꠬ꢀꢁꢴꣅ" ++
