    toList "𝟎𝟿𝨀𝨶𝨻𝩬𝩵𝩵𝪄𝪄𝪛𝪟𝪡𝪯𞀀𞀆𞀈𞀘𞀛𞀡𞀣𞀤𞀦𞀪𞂏𞂏𞄰𞄶𞅀𞅉𞊮𞊮𞋬𞋹𞓬𞓹𞗯𞗮𞗱𞗺𞛣𞛣𞛦𞛦𞛮𞛯𞛵𞛵𞥊𞣐𞣖𞥄𞥐𞥙🯰🯹" ++
    toList "󠄀󠇯"
    ))

  startByCode : ℕ → Bool
  startByCode n = select (n ≟ℕ 36) true (select (n ≟ℕ 95) true
    (eitherFlag (inRange n 65 91) (eitherFlag (inRange n 97 123) (nonAsciiStart n))))

  restByCode : ℕ → Bool
  restByCode n = eitherFlag (inRange n 48 58) (nonAsciiRest n)

identifierStart : Char → Bool
identifierStart c = startByCode (toℕ c)

identifierRest : Char → Bool
identifierRest c = eitherFlag (identifierStart c) (restByCode (toℕ c))

identifierTail : List Char → Bool
identifierTail [] = true
identifierTail (c ∷ cs) = select (whenTrue (identifierRest c)) (identifierTail cs) false

identifier : List Char → Bool
identifier [] = false
identifier (c ∷ cs) = select (whenTrue (identifierStart c)) (identifierTail cs) false

start-dollar : identifierStart '$' ≡ true
start-dollar = refl

start-underscore : identifierStart '_' ≡ true
start-underscore = refl

start-uppercase : (c : _) → (65 ≤ toℕ c) → (toℕ c < 91) → identifierStart c ≡ true
start-uppercase c ge lt =
  selectOrTrue (toℕ c ≟ℕ 36)
    (selectOrTrue (toℕ c ≟ℕ 95)
      (cong (λ b → eitherFlag b (eitherFlag (inRange (toℕ c) 97 123) (nonAsciiStart (toℕ c))))
        (rangeHit (toℕ c) 65 91 ge lt)))

start-lowercase : (c : _) → (97 ≤ toℕ c) → (toℕ c < 123) → identifierStart c ≡ true
start-lowercase c ge lt =
  selectOrTrue (toℕ c ≟ℕ 36)
    (selectOrTrue (toℕ c ≟ℕ 95)
      (eitherRight (inRange (toℕ c) 65 91) (eitherFlag (inRange (toℕ c) 97 123) (nonAsciiStart (toℕ c)))
        (cong (λ b → eitherFlag b (nonAsciiStart (toℕ c))) (rangeHit (toℕ c) 97 123 ge lt))))

start-ascii-other : (c : _) → (toℕ c < 128) → ((toℕ c < 65) ⊎ (90 < toℕ c)) → ((toℕ c < 97) ⊎ (122 < toℕ c)) → (toℕ c ≢ 36) → (toℕ c ≢ 95) → identifierStart c ≡ false
start-ascii-other c ascii upper lower dollar underscore =
  onNo (toℕ c ≟ℕ 36) dollar (onNo (toℕ c ≟ℕ 95) underscore
    (cong₂ eitherFlag (rangeMiss (toℕ c) 65 91 upper)
      (cong₂ eitherFlag (rangeMiss (toℕ c) 97 123 lower) (onYes (toℕ c <? 128) ascii refl))))

rest-start : (c : _) → (identifierStart c ≡ true) → identifierRest c ≡ true
rest-start c eq = cong (λ b → eitherFlag b (restByCode (toℕ c))) eq

rest-digit : (c : _) → (48 ≤ toℕ c) → (toℕ c < 58) → identifierRest c ≡ true
rest-digit c ge lt =
  eitherRight (identifierStart c) (restByCode (toℕ c))
    (cong (λ b → eitherFlag b (nonAsciiRest (toℕ c))) (rangeHit (toℕ c) 48 58 ge lt))

rest-ascii-other : (c : _) → (toℕ c < 128) → (identifierStart c ≡ false) → ((toℕ c < 48) ⊎ (57 < toℕ c)) → identifierRest c ≡ false
rest-ascii-other c ascii start digit =
  cong₂ eitherFlag start
    (cong₂ eitherFlag (rangeMiss (toℕ c) 48 58 digit) (onYes (toℕ c <? 128) ascii refl))

tail-empty : identifierTail [] ≡ true
tail-empty = refl

tail-reject : (c : _) → (cs : _) → (identifierRest c ≡ false) → identifierTail (c ∷ cs) ≡ false
tail-reject c cs eq = onNo (whenTrue (identifierRest c)) (notTrue eq) refl

tail-accept : (c : _) → (cs : _) → (identifierRest c ≡ true) → identifierTail (c ∷ cs) ≡ identifierTail cs
tail-accept c cs eq = onYes (whenTrue (identifierRest c)) eq refl

identifier-empty : identifier [] ≡ false
identifier-empty = refl

identifier-reject : (c : _) → (cs : _) → (identifierStart c ≡ false) → identifier (c ∷ cs) ≡ false
identifier-reject c cs eq = onNo (whenTrue (identifierStart c)) (notTrue eq) refl

identifier-accept : (c : _) → (cs : _) → (identifierStart c ≡ true) → identifier (c ∷ cs) ≡ identifierTail cs
identifier-accept c cs eq = onYes (whenTrue (identifierStart c)) eq refl


reserved : String → Bool
reserved s = any (λ word → isYes (s ≟ word)) ("break" ∷ ("case" ∷ ("catch" ∷ ("class" ∷ ("const" ∷ ("continue" ∷ ("debugger" ∷ ("default" ∷ ("delete" ∷ ("do" ∷ ("else" ∷ ("export" ∷ ("extends" ∷ ("false" ∷ ("finally" ∷ ("for" ∷ ("function" ∷ ("if" ∷ ("import" ∷ ("in" ∷ ("instanceof" ∷ ("new" ∷ ("null" ∷ ("return" ∷ ("super" ∷ ("switch" ∷ ("this" ∷ ("throw" ∷ ("true" ∷ ("try" ∷ ("typeof" ∷ ("var" ∷ ("void" ∷ ("while" ∷ ("with" ∷ ("yield" ∷ []))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))

keyForm : String → KeyForm
keyForm k = select (whenTrue (reserved k)) bracketed
  (select (whenTrue (identifier (toList k))) dotted bracketed)

reserved-words : (s : _) → reserved s ≡ any (λ word → isYes (s ≟ word)) ("break" ∷ ("case" ∷ ("catch" ∷ ("class" ∷ ("const" ∷ ("continue" ∷ ("debugger" ∷ ("default" ∷ ("delete" ∷ ("do" ∷ ("else" ∷ ("export" ∷ ("extends" ∷ ("false" ∷ ("finally" ∷ ("for" ∷ ("function" ∷ ("if" ∷ ("import" ∷ ("in" ∷ ("instanceof" ∷ ("new" ∷ ("null" ∷ ("return" ∷ ("super" ∷ ("switch" ∷ ("this" ∷ ("throw" ∷ ("true" ∷ ("try" ∷ ("typeof" ∷ ("var" ∷ ("void" ∷ ("while" ∷ ("with" ∷ ("yield" ∷ []))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))
reserved-words s = refl

dotted-key : (k : _) → (identifier (toList k) ≡ true) → (reserved k ≡ false) → keyForm k ≡ KeyForm.dotted
dotted-key k id notReserved = onNo (whenTrue (reserved k)) (notTrue notReserved) (onYes (whenTrue (identifier (toList k))) id refl)

invalid-key : (k : _) → (identifier (toList k) ≡ false) → keyForm k ≡ KeyForm.bracketed
invalid-key k eq = selectEither (whenTrue (reserved k)) refl (onNo (whenTrue (identifier (toList k))) (notTrue eq) refl)

reserved-key : (k : _) → (reserved k ≡ true) → keyForm k ≡ KeyForm.bracketed
reserved-key k eq = onYes (whenTrue (reserved k)) eq refl

observed-non-ascii-letters : map keyForm ("α" ∷ ("漢" ∷ ("𐐀" ∷ ("Ⅷ" ∷ [])))) ≡ (KeyForm.dotted ∷ (KeyForm.dotted ∷ (KeyForm.dotted ∷ (KeyForm.dotted ∷ []))))
observed-non-ascii-letters = refl

observed-non-ascii-tail : map keyForm ("á" ∷ ("a٢" ∷ ("a‿" ∷ ("aⅧ" ∷ [])))) ≡ (KeyForm.dotted ∷ (KeyForm.dotted ∷ (KeyForm.dotted ∷ (KeyForm.dotted ∷ []))))
observed-non-ascii-tail = refl

observed-non-ascii-exclusions : map keyForm ("a²" ∷ ("a·" ∷ ("a‌" ∷ ("a‍" ∷ ("℘" ∷ ("℮" ∷ ("゛" ∷ ("٢a" ∷ ("😀" ∷ []))))))))) ≡ (KeyForm.bracketed ∷ (KeyForm.bracketed ∷ (KeyForm.bracketed ∷ (KeyForm.bracketed ∷ (KeyForm.bracketed ∷ (KeyForm.bracketed ∷ (KeyForm.bracketed ∷ (KeyForm.bracketed ∷ (KeyForm.bracketed ∷ [])))))))))
observed-non-ascii-exclusions = refl

private
  flipComparison : Comparison → Comparison
  flipComparison before = after
  flipComparison equal = equal
  flipComparison after = before

  compareNat : ℕ → ℕ → Comparison
  compareNat i j = select (i <? j) before (select (j <? i) after equal)

  natBefore : (i j : ℕ) → i < j → compareNat i j ≡ before
  natBefore i j lt = onYes (i <? j) lt refl

  natAfter : (i j : ℕ) → j < i → compareNat i j ≡ after
  natAfter i j gt = onNo (i <? j) (λ lt → <-asym gt lt) (onYes (j <? i) gt refl)

  natSame : (i : ℕ) → compareNat i i ≡ equal
  natSame i = onNo (i <? i) (<-irrefl refl) (onNo (i <? i) (<-irrefl refl) refl)

  natEqual : (i j : ℕ) → i ≡ j → compareNat i j ≡ equal
  natEqual i j eq = trans (cong (compareNat i) (sym eq)) (natSame i)

  natMirrorCases : (i j : ℕ) → (lt : Dec (i < j)) → (gt : Dec (j < i)) →
    select gt before (select lt after equal) ≡ flipComparison (select lt before (select gt after equal))
  natMirrorCases i j (yes lt) (yes gt) = ⊥-elim (<-asym lt gt)
  natMirrorCases i j (yes lt) (no gt) = refl
  natMirrorCases i j (no lt) (yes gt) = refl
  natMirrorCases i j (no lt) (no gt) = refl

  natMirror : (i j : ℕ) → compareNat j i ≡ flipComparison (compareNat i j)
  natMirror i j = natMirrorCases i j (i <? j) (j <? i)

  advance : Comparison → Comparison → Comparison
  advance before _ = before
  advance equal rest = rest
  advance after _ = after

  lexicographic : {A : Set} → (A → A → Comparison) → List A → List A → Comparison
  lexicographic cmp [] [] = equal
  lexicographic cmp [] (y ∷ ys) = before
  lexicographic cmp (x ∷ xs) [] = after
  lexicographic cmp (x ∷ xs) (y ∷ ys) = advance (cmp x y) (lexicographic cmp xs ys)

  advanceMirror : (c d : Comparison) → advance (flipComparison c) (flipComparison d) ≡ flipComparison (advance c d)
  advanceMirror before d = refl
  advanceMirror equal d = refl
  advanceMirror after d = refl

  lexMirror : {A : Set} → (cmp : A → A → Comparison) →
    ((x y : A) → cmp y x ≡ flipComparison (cmp x y)) →
    (xs ys : List A) → lexicographic cmp ys xs ≡ flipComparison (lexicographic cmp xs ys)
  lexMirror cmp mirror [] [] = refl
  lexMirror cmp mirror [] (y ∷ ys) = refl
  lexMirror cmp mirror (x ∷ xs) [] = refl
  lexMirror cmp mirror (x ∷ xs) (y ∷ ys) =
    trans (cong₂ advance (mirror x y) (lexMirror cmp mirror xs ys)) (advanceMirror (cmp x y) (lexicographic cmp xs ys))

compareText : List Char → List Char → Comparison
compareText = lexicographic (λ c d → compareNat (toℕ c) (toℕ d))

text-empty : compareText [] [] ≡ Comparison.equal
text-empty = refl

text-prefix : (c : _) → (cs : _) → compareText [] (c ∷ cs) ≡ Comparison.before
text-prefix c cs = refl

text-extension : (c : _) → (cs : _) → compareText (c ∷ cs) [] ≡ Comparison.after
text-extension c cs = refl

text-before : (c : _) → (d : _) → (cs : _) → (ds : _) → (toℕ c < toℕ d) → compareText (c ∷ cs) (d ∷ ds) ≡ Comparison.before
text-before c d cs ds lt = cong (λ o → advance o (compareText cs ds)) (natBefore (toℕ c) (toℕ d) lt)

text-after : (c : _) → (d : _) → (cs : _) → (ds : _) → (toℕ d < toℕ c) → compareText (c ∷ cs) (d ∷ ds) ≡ Comparison.after
text-after c d cs ds gt = cong (λ o → advance o (compareText cs ds)) (natAfter (toℕ c) (toℕ d) gt)

text-equal-head : (c : _) → (d : _) → (cs : _) → (ds : _) → (toℕ c ≡ toℕ d) → compareText (c ∷ cs) (d ∷ ds) ≡ compareText cs ds
text-equal-head c d cs ds eq = cong (λ o → advance o (compareText cs ds)) (natEqual (toℕ c) (toℕ d) eq)

private
  textMirror : (cs ds : List Char) → compareText ds cs ≡ flipComparison (compareText cs ds)
  textMirror = lexMirror (λ c d → compareNat (toℕ c) (toℕ d)) (λ c d → natMirror (toℕ c) (toℕ d))

  compareKeys : String → String → KeyForm → KeyForm → Comparison
  compareKeys k l dotted dotted = compareText (toList k) (toList l)
  compareKeys k l dotted bracketed = before
  compareKeys k l bracketed dotted = after
  compareKeys k l bracketed bracketed = compareText (quoted forwardQuote (toList k)) (quoted forwardQuote (toList l))

compareSegment : Base.Segment → Base.Segment → Comparison
compareSegment (Base.index i) (Base.index j) = compareNat i j
compareSegment (Base.key k) (Base.key l) = compareKeys k l (keyForm k) (keyForm l)
compareSegment (Base.key k) (Base.index j) = before
compareSegment (Base.index i) (Base.key l) = after

segment-index-before : (i : _) → (j : _) → (i < j) → compareSegment (Base.index i) (Base.index j) ≡ Comparison.before
segment-index-before = natBefore

segment-index-after : (i : _) → (j : _) → (j < i) → compareSegment (Base.index i) (Base.index j) ≡ Comparison.after
segment-index-after = natAfter

segment-index-equal : (i : _) → compareSegment (Base.index i) (Base.index i) ≡ Comparison.equal
segment-index-equal = natSame

segment-dotted-before : (k : _) → (l : _) → (keyForm k ≡ KeyForm.dotted) → (keyForm l ≡ KeyForm.bracketed) → compareSegment (Base.key k) (Base.key l) ≡ Comparison.before
segment-dotted-before k l hk hl = cong₂ (compareKeys k l) hk hl

segment-dotted-after : (k : _) → (l : _) → (keyForm k ≡ KeyForm.bracketed) → (keyForm l ≡ KeyForm.dotted) → compareSegment (Base.key k) (Base.key l) ≡ Comparison.after
segment-dotted-after k l hk hl = cong₂ (compareKeys k l) hk hl

segment-dotted-pair : (k : _) → (l : _) → (keyForm k ≡ KeyForm.dotted) → (keyForm l ≡ KeyForm.dotted) → compareSegment (Base.key k) (Base.key l) ≡ compareText (toList k) (toList l)
segment-dotted-pair k l hk hl = cong₂ (compareKeys k l) hk hl

segment-bracket-pair : (k : _) → (l : _) → (keyForm k ≡ KeyForm.bracketed) → (keyForm l ≡ KeyForm.bracketed) → compareSegment (Base.key k) (Base.key l) ≡ compareText (quoted Quoting.forwardQuote (toList k)) (quoted Quoting.forwardQuote (toList l))
segment-bracket-pair k l hk hl = cong₂ (compareKeys k l) hk hl

private
  keysMirror : (k l : String) → (kf lf : KeyForm) → compareKeys l k lf kf ≡ flipComparison (compareKeys k l kf lf)
  keysMirror k l dotted dotted = textMirror (toList k) (toList l)
  keysMirror k l dotted bracketed = refl
  keysMirror k l bracketed dotted = refl
  keysMirror k l bracketed bracketed = textMirror (quoted forwardQuote (toList k)) (quoted forwardQuote (toList l))

  segmentMirror : (x y : Base.Segment) → compareSegment y x ≡ flipComparison (compareSegment x y)
  segmentMirror (Base.index i) (Base.index j) = natMirror i j
  segmentMirror (Base.key k) (Base.key l) = keysMirror k l (keyForm k) (keyForm l)
  segmentMirror (Base.key k) (Base.index j) = refl
  segmentMirror (Base.index i) (Base.key l) = refl

comparePath : List Base.Segment → List Base.Segment → Comparison
comparePath = lexicographic compareSegment

path-empty : comparePath [] [] ≡ Comparison.equal
path-empty = refl

path-prefix : (seg : _) → (path : _) → comparePath [] (seg ∷ path) ≡ Comparison.before
path-prefix seg path = refl

path-extension : (seg : _) → (path : _) → comparePath (seg ∷ path) [] ≡ Comparison.after
path-extension seg path = refl

path-head-before : (x : _) → (y : _) → (xs : _) → (ys : _) → (compareSegment x y ≡ Comparison.before) → comparePath (x ∷ xs) (y ∷ ys) ≡ Comparison.before
path-head-before x y xs ys eq = cong (λ o → advance o (comparePath xs ys)) eq

path-head-after : (x : _) → (y : _) → (xs : _) → (ys : _) → (compareSegment x y ≡ Comparison.after) → comparePath (x ∷ xs) (y ∷ ys) ≡ Comparison.after
path-head-after x y xs ys eq = cong (λ o → advance o (comparePath xs ys)) eq

path-head-equal : (x : _) → (y : _) → (xs : _) → (ys : _) → (compareSegment x y ≡ Comparison.equal) → comparePath (x ∷ xs) (y ∷ ys) ≡ comparePath xs ys
path-head-equal x y xs ys eq = cong (λ o → advance o (comparePath xs ys)) eq

compareRow : Base.Row → Base.Row → Comparison
compareRow (Base.row p c) (Base.row q d) = comparePath p q

row-order : (p : _) → (q : _) → (c : _) → (d : _) → compareRow (Base.row p c) (Base.row q d) ≡ comparePath p q
row-order p q c d = refl

private
  rowMirror : (x y : Base.Row) → compareRow y x ≡ flipComparison (compareRow x y)
  rowMirror (Base.row p c) (Base.row q d) = lexMirror compareSegment segmentMirror p q

  place : {A : Set} → Comparison → A → A → List A → List A → List A
  place before x y ys added = x ∷ (y ∷ ys)
  place equal x y ys added = x ∷ (y ∷ ys)
  place after x y ys added = y ∷ added

  insertBy : {A : Set} → (A → A → Comparison) → A → List A → List A
  insertBy cmp x [] = x ∷ []
  insertBy cmp x (y ∷ ys) = place (cmp x y) x y ys (insertBy cmp x ys)

  placePermutation : {A : Set} → (x y : A) → (ys added : List A) →
    Permutation (x ∷ ys) added → (o : Comparison) → Permutation (x ∷ (y ∷ ys)) (place o x y ys added)
  placePermutation x y ys added proof before = permutation-refl
  placePermutation x y ys added proof equal = permutation-refl
  placePermutation x y ys added proof after = permutation-trans permutation-swap (permutation-keep proof)

  insertPermutation : {A : Set} → (cmp : A → A → Comparison) → (x : A) → (ys : List A) → Permutation (x ∷ ys) (insertBy cmp x ys)
  insertPermutation cmp x [] = permutation-refl
  insertPermutation cmp x (y ∷ ys) =
    placePermutation x y ys (insertBy cmp x ys) (insertPermutation cmp x ys) (cmp x y)

  beforeNotAfter : {o : Comparison} → o ≡ before → o ≢ after
  beforeNotAfter refl ()

  equalNotAfter : {o : Comparison} → o ≡ equal → o ≢ after
  equalNotAfter refl ()

  prependPlaced : {A : Set} → (cmp : A → A → Comparison) → (p x y : A) → (ys added : List A) →
    (o : Comparison) → cmp p x ≢ after → cmp p y ≢ after →
    Ordered cmp (place o x y ys added) → Ordered cmp (p ∷ place o x y ys added)
  prependPlaced cmp p x y ys added before px py ordered = ordered-next px ordered
  prependPlaced cmp p x y ys added equal px py ordered = ordered-next px ordered
  prependPlaced cmp p x y ys added after px py ordered = ordered-next py ordered

  prependInserted : {A : Set} → (cmp : A → A → Comparison) → (p x : A) → (ys : List A) →
    cmp p x ≢ after → Ordered cmp (p ∷ ys) → Ordered cmp (insertBy cmp x ys) → Ordered cmp (p ∷ insertBy cmp x ys)
  prependInserted cmp p x [] px old new = ordered-next px new
  prependInserted cmp p x (y ∷ ys) px (ordered-next py tail) new =
    prependPlaced cmp p x y ys (insertBy cmp x ys) (cmp x y) px py new

  placeOrdered : {A : Set} → (cmp : A → A → Comparison) →
    ((u v : A) → cmp v u ≡ flipComparison (cmp u v)) → (x y : A) → (ys : List A) →
    (o : Comparison) → cmp x y ≡ o → Ordered cmp (y ∷ ys) → Ordered cmp (insertBy cmp x ys) →
    Ordered cmp (place o x y ys (insertBy cmp x ys))
  placeOrdered cmp mirror x y ys before eq old new = ordered-next (beforeNotAfter eq) old
  placeOrdered cmp mirror x y ys equal eq old new = ordered-next (equalNotAfter eq) old
  placeOrdered cmp mirror x y ys after eq old new =
    prependInserted cmp y x ys (beforeNotAfter (trans (mirror x y) (cong flipComparison eq))) old new

  insertOrdered : {A : Set} → (cmp : A → A → Comparison) →
    ((u v : A) → cmp v u ≡ flipComparison (cmp u v)) →
    (x : A) → (ys : List A) → Ordered cmp ys → Ordered cmp (insertBy cmp x ys)
  insertOrdered cmp mirror x [] sorted = ordered-single x
  insertOrdered cmp mirror x (y ∷ []) sorted = placeOrdered cmp mirror x y [] (cmp x y) refl sorted (ordered-single x)
  insertOrdered cmp mirror x (y ∷ (z ∷ zs)) (ordered-next yz tail) =
    placeOrdered cmp mirror x y (z ∷ zs) (cmp x y) refl (ordered-next yz tail) (insertOrdered cmp mirror x (z ∷ zs) tail)

  sortBy : {A : Set} → (A → A → Comparison) → List A → List A
  sortBy cmp [] = []
  sortBy cmp (x ∷ xs) = insertBy cmp x (sortBy cmp xs)

  sortPermutation : {A : Set} → (cmp : A → A → Comparison) → (xs : List A) → Permutation xs (sortBy cmp xs)
  sortPermutation cmp [] = permutation-refl
  sortPermutation cmp (x ∷ xs) =
    permutation-trans (permutation-keep (sortPermutation cmp xs)) (insertPermutation cmp x (sortBy cmp xs))

  sortOrdered : {A : Set} → (cmp : A → A → Comparison) →
    ((u v : A) → cmp v u ≡ flipComparison (cmp u v)) → (xs : List A) → Ordered cmp (sortBy cmp xs)
  sortOrdered cmp mirror [] = ordered-empty
  sortOrdered cmp mirror (x ∷ xs) = insertOrdered cmp mirror x (sortBy cmp xs) (sortOrdered cmp mirror xs)

orderRows : List Base.Row → List Base.Row
orderRows = sortBy compareRow

orderMembers : List (String × List Char) → List (String × List Char)
orderMembers = sortBy (λ f g → compareText (toList (proj₁ f)) (toList (proj₁ g)))

rows-preserved : (rs : _) → Permutation rs (orderRows rs)
rows-preserved = sortPermutation compareRow

rows-ordered : (rs : _) → Ordered compareRow (orderRows rs)
rows-ordered = sortOrdered compareRow rowMirror

members-preserved : (fs : _) → Permutation fs (orderMembers fs)
members-preserved = sortPermutation (λ f g → compareText (toList (proj₁ f)) (toList (proj₁ g)))

members-ordered : (fs : _) → Ordered (λ f g → compareText (toList (proj₁ f)) (toList (proj₁ g))) (orderMembers fs)
members-ordered = sortOrdered (λ f g → compareText (toList (proj₁ f)) (toList (proj₁ g))) (λ f g → textMirror (toList (proj₁ f)) (toList (proj₁ g)))

join : List Char → List (List Char) → List Char
join sep [] = []
join sep (x ∷ []) = x
join sep (x ∷ (y ∷ ys)) = x ++ (sep ++ join sep (y ∷ ys))

join-empty : (sep : _) → join sep [] ≡ []
join-empty sep = refl

join-single : (sep : _) → (x : _) → join sep (x ∷ []) ≡ x
join-single sep x = refl

join-next : (sep : _) → (x : _) → (y : _) → (ys : _) → join sep (x ∷ (y ∷ ys)) ≡ (x ++ (sep ++ join sep (y ∷ ys)))
join-next sep x y ys = refl

private
  renderAssignmentKey : Style → String → KeyForm → List Char
  renderAssignmentKey s k dotted = '.' ∷ paint s blueBold (toList k)
  renderAssignmentKey s k bracketed =
    paint s violet [ '[' ] ++ (paint s yellow (quoted forwardQuote (toList k)) ++ paint s violet [ ']' ])

assignmentStep : Style → Base.Segment → List Char
assignmentStep s (Base.key k) = renderAssignmentKey s k (keyForm k)
assignmentStep s (Base.index i) =
  paint s violet [ '[' ] ++ (paint s red (toList (primShowNat i)) ++ paint s violet [ ']' ])

assignmentSuffix : Style → List Base.Segment → List Char
assignmentSuffix s [] = []
assignmentSuffix s (x ∷ xs) = assignmentStep s x ++ assignmentSuffix s xs

jsonPathPart : Style → Base.Segment → List Char
jsonPathPart s (Base.key k) = paint s yellow (quoted forwardQuote (toList k))
jsonPathPart s (Base.index i) = paint s red (toList (primShowNat i))

forwardCell : Style → Base.Cell → List Char
forwardCell s Base.objectCell = paint s violet (toList "{}")
forwardCell s Base.arrayCell = paint s violet (toList "[]")
forwardCell s (Base.leaf Base.null) = paint s cyan (toList "null")
forwardCell s (Base.leaf (Base.truth true)) = paint s cyan (toList "true")
forwardCell s (Base.leaf (Base.truth false)) = paint s cyan (toList "false")
forwardCell s (Base.leaf (Base.numeral n)) = paint s red (toList n)
forwardCell s (Base.leaf (Base.text t)) = paint s yellow (quoted forwardQuote (toList t))

forwardLine : Style → RowFormat → Base.Row → List Char
forwardLine s assignments (Base.row p c) =
  paint s blueBold (toList "json") ++ (assignmentSuffix s p ++ (toList " = " ++ (forwardCell s c ++ toList ";\n")))
forwardLine s jsonRows (Base.row p c) =
  paint s violet [ '[' ] ++ (paint s violet [ '[' ] ++ (join [ ',' ] (map (jsonPathPart s) p) ++
    (paint s violet [ ']' ] ++ ([ ',' ] ++ (forwardCell s c ++ (paint s violet [ ']' ] ++ [ '\n' ]))))))

forwardOutput : Style → RowFormat → Bool → List Base.Row → String
forwardOutput s f false rs = fromList (join [] (map (forwardLine s f) rs))
forwardOutput s f true rs = fromList (join [] (map (forwardLine s f) (orderRows rs)))

assignment-key-dot : (s : _) → (k : _) → (keyForm k ≡ KeyForm.dotted) → assignmentStep s (Base.key k) ≡ ('.' ∷ paint s Tone.blueBold (toList k))
assignment-key-dot s k eq = cong (renderAssignmentKey s k) eq

assignment-key-bracket : (s : _) → (k : _) → (keyForm k ≡ KeyForm.bracketed) → assignmentStep s (Base.key k) ≡ (paint s Tone.violet ([ '[' ]) ++ (paint s Tone.yellow (quoted Quoting.forwardQuote (toList k)) ++ paint s Tone.violet ([ ']' ])))
assignment-key-bracket s k eq = cong (renderAssignmentKey s k) eq

assignment-index : (s : _) → (i : _) → assignmentStep s (Base.index i) ≡ (paint s Tone.violet ([ '[' ]) ++ (paint s Tone.red (toList (primShowNat i)) ++ paint s Tone.violet ([ ']' ])))
assignment-index s i = refl

suffix-empty : (s : _) → assignmentSuffix s [] ≡ []
suffix-empty s = refl

suffix-cons : (s : _) → (x : _) → (xs : _) → assignmentSuffix s (x ∷ xs) ≡ (assignmentStep s x ++ assignmentSuffix s xs)
suffix-cons s x xs = refl

row-key-part : (s : _) → (k : _) → jsonPathPart s (Base.key k) ≡ paint s Tone.yellow (quoted Quoting.forwardQuote (toList k))
row-key-part s k = refl

row-index-part : (s : _) → (i : _) → jsonPathPart s (Base.index i) ≡ paint s Tone.red (toList (primShowNat i))
row-index-part s i = refl

forward-object-cell : (s : _) → forwardCell s Base.objectCell ≡ paint s Tone.violet (toList "{}")
forward-object-cell s = refl

forward-array-cell : (s : _) → forwardCell s Base.arrayCell ≡ paint s Tone.violet (toList "[]")
forward-array-cell s = refl

forward-null : (s : _) → forwardCell s (Base.leaf Base.null) ≡ paint s Tone.cyan (toList "null")
forward-null s = refl

forward-true : (s : _) → forwardCell s (Base.leaf (Base.truth true)) ≡ paint s Tone.cyan (toList "true")
forward-true s = refl

forward-false : (s : _) → forwardCell s (Base.leaf (Base.truth false)) ≡ paint s Tone.cyan (toList "false")
forward-false s = refl

forward-number : (s : _) → (n : _) → forwardCell s (Base.leaf (Base.numeral n)) ≡ paint s Tone.red (toList n)
forward-number s n = refl

forward-text : (s : _) → (t : _) → forwardCell s (Base.leaf (Base.text t)) ≡ paint s Tone.yellow (quoted Quoting.forwardQuote (toList t))
forward-text s t = refl

assignment-line : (s : _) → (p : _) → (c : _) → forwardLine s RowFormat.assignments (Base.row p c) ≡ (paint s Tone.blueBold (toList "json") ++ (assignmentSuffix s p ++ (toList " = " ++ (forwardCell s c ++ toList ";\n"))))
assignment-line s p c = refl

json-row-line : (s : _) → (p : _) → (c : _) → forwardLine s RowFormat.jsonRows (Base.row p c) ≡ (paint s Tone.violet ([ '[' ]) ++ (paint s Tone.violet ([ '[' ]) ++ (join ([ ',' ]) (map (jsonPathPart s) p) ++ (paint s Tone.violet ([ ']' ]) ++ (([ ',' ]) ++ (forwardCell s c ++ (paint s Tone.violet ([ ']' ]) ++ ([ '\n' ]))))))))
json-row-line s p c = refl

output-unsorted : (s : _) → (f : _) → (rs : _) → forwardOutput s f false rs ≡ fromList (join [] (map (forwardLine s f) rs))
output-unsorted s f rs = refl

output-sorted : (s : _) → (f : _) → (rs : _) → forwardOutput s f true rs ≡ fromList (join [] (map (forwardLine s f) (orderRows rs)))
output-sorted s f rs = refl

indent : ℕ → List Char
indent zero = []
indent (suc depth) = ' ' ∷ (' ' ∷ indent depth)

reverseEntry : Style → String → List Char → List Char
reverseEntry plain k v = quoted reverseQuote (toList k) ++ (toList ": " ++ v)
reverseEntry ansi k v =
  paint ansi blueBold [ '\"' ] ++ (paint ansi blueBold (escapeBody reverseQuote (toList k)) ++
    (paint ansi blueBold [ '\"' ] ++ (paint ansi bold [ ':' ] ++ v)))

reverseGroup : Style → ℕ → Char → Char → List (List Char) → List Char
reverseGroup plain depth l r [] = l ∷ (r ∷ [])
reverseGroup plain depth l r (v ∷ vs) =
  (l ∷ ('\n' ∷ indent (suc depth))) ++
    (join (',' ∷ ('\n' ∷ indent (suc depth))) (v ∷ vs) ++ (('\n' ∷ indent depth) ++ [ r ]))
reverseGroup ansi depth l r vs =
  paint ansi violet [ l ] ++ (join (paint ansi bold [ ',' ]) vs ++ paint ansi violet [ r ])

reverseValue : Style → ℕ → Base.Value → List Char
renderArrayValues : Style → ℕ → List Base.Value → List (List Char)
renderObjectValues : Style → ℕ → List (String × Base.Value) → List (String × List Char)
reverseValue s depth (Base.scalar Base.null) = forwardCell s (Base.leaf Base.null)
reverseValue s depth (Base.scalar (Base.truth true)) = forwardCell s (Base.leaf (Base.truth true))
reverseValue s depth (Base.scalar (Base.truth false)) = forwardCell s (Base.leaf (Base.truth false))
reverseValue s depth (Base.scalar (Base.numeral n)) = forwardCell s (Base.leaf (Base.numeral n))
reverseValue plain depth (Base.scalar (Base.text t)) = quoted reverseQuote (toList t)
reverseValue ansi depth (Base.scalar (Base.text t)) =
  paint ansi green [ '\"' ] ++ (paint ansi yellow (escapeBody reverseQuote (toList t)) ++ paint ansi green [ '\"' ])
reverseValue s depth (Base.array xs) =
  reverseGroup s depth '[' ']' (renderArrayValues s (suc depth) xs)
reverseValue s depth (Base.object fs) =
  reverseGroup s depth '{' '}'
    (map (λ f → reverseEntry s (proj₁ f) (proj₂ f)) (orderMembers (renderObjectValues s (suc depth) fs)))
renderArrayValues s depth [] = []
renderArrayValues s depth (v ∷ vs) = reverseValue s depth v ∷ renderArrayValues s depth vs
renderObjectValues s depth [] = []
renderObjectValues s depth ((k , v) ∷ fs) = (k , reverseValue s depth v) ∷ renderObjectValues s depth fs

reverseOutput : Style → Base.Value → String
reverseOutput s v = fromList (reverseValue s zero v ++ [ '\n' ])

mergeDiagnostic : Base.MergeFault → String
mergeDiagnostic Base.objectConflict = "failed to merge statements: cannot merge object with non-object\n"
mergeDiagnostic Base.arrayConflict = "failed to merge statements: cannot merge array with non-array\n"

indent-root : indent zero ≡ []
indent-root = refl

indent-next : (depth : _) → indent (suc depth) ≡ (' ' ∷ (' ' ∷ indent depth))
indent-next depth = refl

reverse-empty-group : (depth : _) → (l : _) → (r : _) → reverseGroup Style.plain depth l r [] ≡ (l ∷ (r ∷ []))
reverse-empty-group depth l r = refl

reverse-pretty-group : (depth : _) → (l : _) → (r : _) → (v : _) → (vs : _) → reverseGroup Style.plain depth l r (v ∷ vs) ≡ ((l ∷ ('\n' ∷ indent (suc depth))) ++ (join (',' ∷ ('\n' ∷ indent (suc depth))) (v ∷ vs) ++ (('\n' ∷ indent depth) ++ ([ r ]))))
reverse-pretty-group depth l r v vs = refl

reverse-ansi-group : (depth : _) → (l : _) → (r : _) → (vs : _) → reverseGroup Style.ansi depth l r vs ≡ (paint Style.ansi Tone.violet ([ l ]) ++ (join (paint Style.ansi Tone.bold ([ ',' ])) vs ++ paint Style.ansi Tone.violet ([ r ])))
reverse-ansi-group depth l r vs = refl

reverse-plain-entry : (k : _) → (v : _) → reverseEntry Style.plain k v ≡ (quoted Quoting.reverseQuote (toList k) ++ (toList ": " ++ v))
reverse-plain-entry k v = refl

reverse-ansi-entry : (k : _) → (v : _) → reverseEntry Style.ansi k v ≡ (paint Style.ansi Tone.blueBold ([ '\"' ]) ++ (paint Style.ansi Tone.blueBold (escapeBody Quoting.reverseQuote (toList k)) ++ (paint Style.ansi Tone.blueBold ([ '\"' ]) ++ (paint Style.ansi Tone.bold ([ ':' ]) ++ v))))
reverse-ansi-entry k v = refl

reverse-null : (s : _) → (depth : _) → reverseValue s depth (Base.scalar Base.null) ≡ paint s Tone.cyan (toList "null")
reverse-null s depth = forward-null s

reverse-true : (s : _) → (depth : _) → reverseValue s depth (Base.scalar (Base.truth true)) ≡ paint s Tone.cyan (toList "true")
reverse-true s depth = forward-true s

reverse-false : (s : _) → (depth : _) → reverseValue s depth (Base.scalar (Base.truth false)) ≡ paint s Tone.cyan (toList "false")
reverse-false s depth = forward-false s

reverse-number : (s : _) → (depth : _) → (n : _) → reverseValue s depth (Base.scalar (Base.numeral n)) ≡ paint s Tone.red (toList n)
reverse-number s depth n = forward-number s n

reverse-plain-text : (depth : _) → (t : _) → reverseValue Style.plain depth (Base.scalar (Base.text t)) ≡ quoted Quoting.reverseQuote (toList t)
reverse-plain-text depth t = refl

reverse-ansi-text : (depth : _) → (t : _) → reverseValue Style.ansi depth (Base.scalar (Base.text t)) ≡ (paint Style.ansi Tone.green ([ '\"' ]) ++ (paint Style.ansi Tone.yellow (escapeBody Quoting.reverseQuote (toList t)) ++ paint Style.ansi Tone.green ([ '\"' ])))
reverse-ansi-text depth t = refl

private
  arrayValues-law : (s : Style) → (depth : ℕ) → (xs : List Base.Value) →
    renderArrayValues s depth xs ≡ map (reverseValue s depth) xs
  arrayValues-law s depth [] = refl
  arrayValues-law s depth (v ∷ vs) =
    cong (λ tail → reverseValue s depth v ∷ tail) (arrayValues-law s depth vs)

  objectValues-law : (s : Style) → (depth : ℕ) → (fs : List (String × Base.Value)) →
    renderObjectValues s depth fs ≡ map (λ f → proj₁ f , reverseValue s depth (proj₂ f)) fs
  objectValues-law s depth [] = refl
  objectValues-law s depth ((k , v) ∷ fs) =
    cong (λ tail → (k , reverseValue s depth v) ∷ tail) (objectValues-law s depth fs)

reverse-array : (s : _) → (depth : _) → (xs : _) → reverseValue s depth (Base.array xs) ≡ reverseGroup s depth '[' ']' (map (reverseValue s (suc depth)) xs)
reverse-array s depth xs = cong (reverseGroup s depth '[' ']') (arrayValues-law s (suc depth) xs)

reverse-object : (s : _) → (depth : _) → (fs : _) → reverseValue s depth (Base.object fs) ≡ reverseGroup s depth '{' '}' (map (λ f → reverseEntry s (proj₁ f) (proj₂ f)) (orderMembers (map (λ f → proj₁ f , reverseValue s (suc depth) (proj₂ f)) fs)))
reverse-object s depth fs =
  cong (λ fields → reverseGroup s depth '{' '}' (map (λ f → reverseEntry s (proj₁ f) (proj₂ f)) (orderMembers fields)))
    (objectValues-law s (suc depth) fs)

reverse-newline : (s : _) → (v : _) → reverseOutput s v ≡ fromList (reverseValue s zero v ++ ([ '\n' ]))
reverse-newline s v = refl

object-conflict : mergeDiagnostic Base.objectConflict ≡ "failed to merge statements: cannot merge object with non-object\n"
object-conflict = refl

array-conflict : mergeDiagnostic Base.arrayConflict ≡ "failed to merge statements: cannot merge array with non-array\n"
array-conflict = refl

valueText : Base.Atom → List Char
valueText Base.null = toList "null"
valueText (Base.truth true) = toList "true"
valueText (Base.truth false) = toList "false"
valueText (Base.numeral n) = toList n
valueText (Base.text t) = toList t

valuesOutput : List (Maybe Base.Row) → String
valuesOutput rs = fromList (join [] (map (λ a → valueText a ++ [ '\n' ]) (Base.valuesOf rs)))

values-null : valueText Base.null ≡ toList "null"
values-null = refl

values-true : valueText (Base.truth true) ≡ toList "true"
values-true = refl

values-false : valueText (Base.truth false) ≡ toList "false"
values-false = refl

values-number : (n : _) → valueText (Base.numeral n) ≡ toList n
values-number n = refl

values-text : (t : _) → valueText (Base.text t) ≡ toList t
values-text t = refl

output-values : (rs : _) → valuesOutput rs ≡ fromList (join [] (map (λ a → valueText a ++ ([ '\n' ])) (Base.valuesOf rs)))
output-values rs = refl

observed-forward-paths : forwardOutput Style.plain RowFormat.jsonRows true (Base.row [] Base.objectCell ∷ (Base.row (Base.key "a.b" ∷ []) (Base.leaf Base.null) ∷ (Base.row (Base.key "z" ∷ []) Base.arrayCell ∷ (Base.row (Base.key "z" ∷ (Base.index 0 ∷ [])) (Base.leaf (Base.numeral "1")) ∷ (Base.row (Base.key "z" ∷ (Base.index 1 ∷ [])) (Base.leaf (Base.text "<&>")) ∷ []))))) ≡ "[[],{}]\n[[\"z\"],[]]\n[[\"z\",0],1]\n[[\"z\",1],\"<&>\"]\n[[\"a.b\"],null]\n"
observed-forward-paths = refl

observed-reverse-members : reverseOutput Style.plain (Base.object (("a" , Base.scalar (Base.numeral "1000000000")) ∷ (("A" , Base.scalar (Base.truth false)) ∷ (("<&>" , Base.scalar (Base.text (fromList ('x' ∷ (fromℕ 8232 ∷ ('y' ∷ (fromℕ 8233 ∷ ('z' ∷ (fromℕ 1 ∷ []))))))))) ∷ [])))) ≡ "{\n  \"<&>\": \"x\\u2028y\\u2029z\\u0001\",\n  \"A\": false,\n  \"a\": 1000000000\n}\n"
observed-reverse-members = refl

observed-quoted-order : compareSegment (Base.key ". ") (Base.key ".") ≡ Comparison.before
observed-quoted-order = refl

observed-forward-quote : fromList (quoted Quoting.forwardQuote (toList "<>&" ++ (fromℕ 127 ∷ (fromℕ 8233 ∷ (fromℕ 31 ∷ toList "/\"\\😀"))))) ≡ "\"<>&\\u007F\\u2029\\u001F/\\\"\\\\😀\""
observed-forward-quote = refl

observed-reverse-quote : quoted Quoting.reverseQuote (fromℕ 11 ∷ (fromℕ 31 ∷ (fromℕ 127 ∷ (fromℕ 133 ∷ (fromℕ 8232 ∷ (fromℕ 8233 ∷ toList "<>&")))))) ≡ (toList "\"\\u000b\\u001f" ++ (fromℕ 127 ∷ (fromℕ 133 ∷ toList "\\u2028\\u2029<>&\"")))
observed-reverse-quote = refl

observed-json-color : forwardLine Style.ansi RowFormat.jsonRows (Base.row (Base.key "x" ∷ []) (Base.leaf (Base.numeral "1"))) ≡ ((fromℕ 27 ∷ toList "[35m[") ++ ((fromℕ 27 ∷ toList "[0m") ++ ((fromℕ 27 ∷ toList "[35m[") ++ ((fromℕ 27 ∷ toList "[0m") ++ ((fromℕ 27 ∷ toList "[33m\"x\"") ++ ((fromℕ 27 ∷ toList "[0m") ++ ((fromℕ 27 ∷ toList "[35m]") ++ ((fromℕ 27 ∷ toList "[0m,") ++ ((fromℕ 27 ∷ toList "[31m1") ++ ((fromℕ 27 ∷ toList "[0m") ++ ((fromℕ 27 ∷ toList "[35m]") ++ (fromℕ 27 ∷ toList "[0m\n"))))))))))))
observed-json-color = refl

observed-empty-color : reverseOutput Style.ansi (Base.scalar (Base.text "")) ≡ fromList ((fromℕ 27 ∷ toList "[32m\"") ++ ((fromℕ 27 ∷ toList "[0m") ++ ((fromℕ 27 ∷ toList "[33m") ++ ((fromℕ 27 ∷ toList "[0m") ++ ((fromℕ 27 ∷ toList "[32m\"") ++ (fromℕ 27 ∷ toList "[0m\n"))))))
observed-empty-color = refl

```
